    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Plane is a thrilling airborne hospitality simulator that costs way less than a plane ticket! Board passengers, assist with their trivial struggles, and resolve emergency situations all by yourself in this hyper-realistic representation of a commercial flight in 1999 New Zealand. Enjoy the world-class airport, babies crying at 30,000 feet, and very reliable aircraft systems. Also, please don't let the psychopomp fly the aircraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Board passengers, keep them comfortable, and strive to provide a survivable flight for all paying customers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide who boards the plane! Customer satisfaction is what it's all about, but some passengers just aren't worth the hassle. If someone looks like a troublemaker, feel free to reject them at boarding and luxuriate in their absence during the flight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless (99+) interactable objects, both in the airport and on the plane!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hyper-realist representation of 1999 New Zealand. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the occult mysteries of the airplane bathroom... </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And pet the cat!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Plane is a thrilling airborne hospitality simulator that costs way less than a plane ticket! Board passengers, assist with their trivial struggles, and resolve emergency situations all by yourself in this hyper-realistic representation of a commercial flight in 1999 New Zealand. Enjoy the world-class airport, babies crying at 30,000 feet, and very reliable aircraft systems. Also, please don't let the psychopomp fly the aircraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Board passengers, keep them comfortable, and strive to provide a survivable flight for all paying customers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide who boards the plane! Customer satisfaction is what it's all about, but some passengers just aren't worth the hassle. If someone looks like a troublemaker, feel free to reject them at boarding and luxuriate in their absence during the flight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless (99+) interactable objects, both in the airport and on the plane!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hyper-realist representation of 1999 New Zealand. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the occult mysteries of the airplane bathroom... </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And pet the cat!</p></li></ul>",
